Yaju
$cards
DECK 2 SPADES

$initial
PAIYU 5 FACE_LAST
PAIYU 10 FACE_LAST
PAIYU 1 FACE_LAST
PAIYU 5 FACE_LAST
PAIYU 5 FACE_LAST

$moves
MOVE PAIYU PAIYU
AND
    OR
        DESTSRC Suit alternate_color
        DEST Rank K
    OR
        DESTSRC Rank descending
        DEST Rank 1
MOVE_STACK PAIYU PAIYU
OR
    SRC Suit {DIAMONDS, HEARTS, SPADES, CLUBS}
    SRC Suit {DIAMONDS, HEARTS, SPADES, CLUBS}
$win
AND
    OR
        PILE ALL PAIYU Empty
        PILE ALL PAIYU Empty
    OR
        PILE ALL PAIYU Empty
        PILE ALL PAIYU Empty
